      "item_id": "MKD-RES-2023-001-0036",
      "information_type": "finding",
      "stated_text": "The need for customer care clerks in the Skopje region is high; 68 workers are needed for each job vacancy. At the same time, the wage for these workers in the borderline regions in the county is 17.7% higher in North Macedonia, opening the possibility of attracting workers from Serbia.",
